<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>T1 · HMI Data Logger Inteligente</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-base: #0b0f14;
      --bg-panel: #121821;
      --bg-panel-alt: #18212d;
      --bg-input: #0d131a;
      --border: #253244;
      --border-focus: #38bdf8;
      --text-main: #e2e8f0;
      --text-muted: #94a3b8;
      --text-dim: #64748b;
      --accent: #38bdf8;
      --accent-glow: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.18);
      --ok: #10b981;
      --ok-bg: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.14);
      --warn: #f59e0b;
      --warn-bg: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.14);
      --err: #ef4444;
      --err-bg: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.14);
      --mono: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, "Liberation Mono", monospace;
      --sans: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    body {
      background: var(--bg-base);
      color: var(--text-main);
      font-family: var(--sans);
      line-height: 1.5;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    /* HEADER INDUSTRIAL */
    header {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #131b26 0%, #0e141c 100%);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 0.9rem 1.5rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.85rem;
    }

    .brand-badge {
      background: var(--accent-glow);
      border: 1px solid var(--accent);
      color: var(--accent);
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      padding: 0.3rem 0.6rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }

    .brand h1 {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      color: #f8fafc;
    }

    .brand span {
      display: block;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    .tabs {
      display: flex;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      background: var(--bg-input);
      padding: 0.3rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .tab-btn {
      background: transparent;
      border: none;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      padding: 0.55rem 1.1rem;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      border-radius: 6px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.18s ease;
    }

    .tab-btn:hover { color: var(--text-main); }

    .tab-btn.active {
      background: var(--bg-panel-alt);
      color: var(--accent);
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.35);
    }

    /* MAIN CONTAINER */
    main {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 1400px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 1.25rem;
      flex: 1;
    }

    .tab-panel { display: none; }
    .tab-panel.active { display: block; }

    /* GRID & CARDS */
    .grid-top {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
      gap: 1.25rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }

    .grid-kpis {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr);
      gap: 0.9rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }

    .grid-main {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.35fr 1fr;
      gap: 1.25rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 1100px) {
      .grid-top, .grid-main { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .grid-kpis { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .grid-kpis { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    }

    .card {
      background: var(--bg-panel);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 1.15rem;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
    }

    .card-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
      padding-bottom: 0.6rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .card-title {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-weight: 700;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    /* FORMULARIOS Y CONTROLES */
    .form-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 0.9rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 700px) {
      .form-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }

    .field { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.35rem; }

    label {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    input[type="password"],
    input[type="url"],
    input[type="text"] {
      background: var(--bg-input);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--text-main);
      padding: 0.6rem 0.75rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      outline: none;
      transition: border-color 0.2s;
    }

    input:focus { border-color: var(--border-focus); }

    .validation-msg {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      min-height: 1.1rem;
      font-family: var(--mono);
    }

    .security-banner {
      margin-top: 0.75rem;
      background: var(--warn-bg);
      border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.4);
      color: #fcd34d;
      padding: 0.65rem 0.85rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 0.55rem;
    }

    /* SLIDER & BOTONES */
    .slider-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1rem;
      margin: 0.6rem 0 1rem;
    }

    input[type="range"] {
      flex: 1;
      accent-color: var(--accent);
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .interval-pill {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      background: var(--bg-input);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 0.35rem 0.7rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--accent);
      min-width: 72px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .btn-group {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.6rem;
    }

    button.btn {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: var(--bg-panel-alt);
      color: var(--text-main);
      padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.45rem;
      transition: all 0.15s ease;
    }

    button.btn:hover:not(:disabled) {
      border-color: var(--accent);
      color: #fff;
    }

    button.btn:disabled {
      opacity: 0.42;
      cursor: not-allowed;
    }

    button.btn-primary {
      background: #0284c7;
      border-color: #38bdf8;
      color: #fff;
    }

    button.btn-primary:hover:not(:disabled) { background: #0369a1; }

    button.btn-warn {
      background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.18);
      border-color: var(--warn);
      color: #fbbf24;
    }

    button.btn-ai {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f766e 0%, #0369a1 100%);
      border-color: #2dd4bf;
      color: #fff;
    }

    /* KPIS */
    .kpi {
      background: var(--bg-panel);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 9px;
      padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .kpi-label {
      font-size: 0.74rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    }

    .kpi-val {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 1.55rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #f8fafc;
    }

    .kpi-sub {
      font-size: 0.74rem;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      margin-top: 0.25rem;
      font-family: var(--mono);
    }

    .val-ok { color: var(--ok); }
    .val-warn { color: var(--warn); }
    .val-err { color: var(--err); }
    .val-accent { color: var(--accent); }

    /* INDICADORES DE ESTADO */
    .status-bar {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.65rem;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.4rem;
      padding: 0.28rem 0.65rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 0.76rem;
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-weight: 600;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: var(--bg-input);
    }

    .dot {
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--text-dim);
    }

    .badge.ok { background: var(--ok-bg); border-color: rgba(16,185,129,0.4); color: #6ee7b7; }
    .badge.ok .dot { background: var(--ok); box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--ok); }

    .badge.warn { background: var(--warn-bg); border-color: rgba(245,158,11,0.4); color: #fcd34d; }
    .badge.warn .dot { background: var(--warn); box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--warn); }

    .badge.err { background: var(--err-bg); border-color: rgba(239,68,68,0.4); color: #fca5a5; }
    .badge.err .dot { background: var(--err); box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--err); }

    /* CANVAS CHART */
    .chart-wrap {
      width: 100%;
      height: 250px;
      background: var(--bg-input);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 0.5rem;
      position: relative;
    }

    canvas { width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; }

    /* COLA Y LOGS */
    .queue-list {
      max-height: 250px;
      overflow-y: auto;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.45rem;
    }

    .queue-item {
      background: var(--bg-input);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 0.55rem 0.75rem;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    /* TABLA HISTORIAL SHEETS */
    .table-wrap {
      overflow-x: auto;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 8px;
      max-height: 330px;
    }

    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
    }

    th, td {
      padding: 0.6rem 0.75rem;
      text-align: left;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    th {
      background: var(--bg-panel-alt);
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.74rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
    }

    td { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.79rem; }
    tr:hover td { background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.04); }

    /* PANEL ANÁLISIS IA */
    .ai-output {
      background: var(--bg-input);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 1rem;
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      white-space: pre-wrap;
      min-height: 130px;
      color: #e2e8f0;
    }

    /* PESTANA 2: DOCUMENTACIÓN Y CODE.GS */
    .doc-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr;
      gap: 1.25rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 1000px) {
      .doc-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }

    .doc-section h2 {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      color: var(--accent);
      margin: 1rem 0 0.45rem;
    }

    .doc-section h2:first-child { margin-top: 0; }

    .doc-section p, .doc-section li {
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .doc-section ul, .doc-section ol {
      padding-left: 1.25rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
    }

    .doc-section strong { color: var(--text-main); }

    pre.code-box {
      background: #070a0e;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 1rem;
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      color: #cbd5e1;
      overflow-x: auto;
      max-height: 680px;
      line-height: 1.45;
    }

    .alert-box {
      background: var(--err-bg);
      border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.45);
      color: #fecaca;
      padding: 0.8rem 1rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 0.84rem;
      margin: 0.75rem 0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="brand-badge">T1 · HMI</div>
      <div>
        <h1>HMI Data Logger Inteligente</h1>
        <span>Telemetría Térmica · Cola Secuencial · Google Sheets & OpenAI</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="status-bar">
      <span id="badgeOp" class="badge"><span class="dot"></span>DETENIDO</span>
      <span id="badgeConn" class="badge"><span class="dot"></span>SIN VALIDAR</span>
      <span id="badgeErr" class="badge ok"><span class="dot"></span>0 ERRORES</span>
    </div>

    <nav class="tabs" aria-label="Navegación principal">
      <button class="tab-btn active" data-tab="tab-demo">1. Demostración</button>
      <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="tab-build">2. Crear artefacto</button>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <!-- =========================================================
         PESTAÑA 1: DEMOSTRACIÓN OPERATIVA
         ========================================================= -->
    <section id="tab-demo" class="tab-panel active">

      <!-- CONFIGURACIÓN Y CONTROL DE GENERACIÓN -->
      <div class="grid-top">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-header">
            <span class="card-title">1. Credenciales y Enlace Backend (Obligatorio)</span>
            <span id="configStatusText" style="font-family:var(--mono);font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--warn);">PENDIENTE</span>
          </div>

          <div class="form-grid">
            <div class="field">
              <label for="apiKeyInput">OpenAI API Key (sk-...)</label>
              <input type="password" id="apiKeyInput" placeholder="sk-proj-..." autocomplete="off" />
              <span id="apiKeyMsg" class="validation-msg">Requerida para habilitar operaciones.</span>
            </div>

            <div class="field">
              <label for="scriptUrlInput">URL Web App Google Apps Script (/exec)</label>
              <input type="url" id="scriptUrlInput" placeholder="https://script.google.com/macros/s/.../exec" autocomplete="off" />
              <span id="urlMsg" class="validation-msg">Debe terminar en /exec sobre HTTPS.</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="security-banner" role="alert">
            <span>⚠️</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Advertencia de seguridad:</strong> Ninguna clave se almacena en <code>localStorage</code> ni en el código fuente. Sin embargo, toda API Key introducida en el navegador viaja en la memoria de sesión y puede quedar expuesta en herramientas de red o extensiones del cliente. En entornos productivos, configure la clave exclusivamente como <em>Script Property</em> en el servidor.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-header">
            <span class="card-title">2. Generador Automático & Cola Secuencial</span>
            <span style="font-family:var(--mono);font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--text-muted);">RANGO: 20.0–40.0 °C</span>
          </div>

          <label for="intervalSlider">Intervalo de muestreo automático (20 a 60 segundos):</label>
          <div class="slider-row">
            <input type="range" id="intervalSlider" min="20" max="60" step="1" value="20" />
            <div class="interval-pill"><span id="intervalLabel">20</span> s</div>
          </div>

          <div class="btn-group">
            <button id="btnStart" class="btn btn-primary" disabled>▶ Iniciar</button>
            <button id="btnPause" class="btn btn-warn" disabled>⏸ Pausar</button>
            <button id="btnSync" class="btn" disabled>↻ Consultar Sheets</button>
            <button id="btnAnalyze" class="btn btn-ai" disabled>✦ Analizar con OpenAI</button>
          </div>
          <p style="font-size:0.76rem;color:var(--text-dim);margin-top:0.7rem;">
            El temporizador genera una muestra cada <strong>t</strong> segundos sin bloquearse por la latencia de Google Sheets. Los envíos se despachan uno a uno desde la cola FIFO.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- KPIS DASHBOARD -->
      <div class="grid-kpis">
        <div class="kpi">
          <span class="kpi-label">Temp. Actual</span>
          <span id="kpiCurrent" class="kpi-val val-accent">--.- °C</span>
          <span id="kpiLastId" class="kpi-sub">ID: ---</span>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi">
          <span class="kpi-label">Promedio Local</span>
          <span id="kpiAvg" class="kpi-val">--.- °C</span>
          <span class="kpi-sub">Muestras sesión</span>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi">
          <span class="kpi-label">Cuenta Regresiva</span>
          <span id="kpiCountdown" class="kpi-val">-- s</span>
          <span class="kpi-sub">Próximo ciclo</span>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi">
          <span class="kpi-label">Generadas</span>
          <span id="kpiGen" class="kpi-val">0</span>
          <span class="kpi-sub">Emitidas por HMI</span>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi">
          <span class="kpi-label">Confirmadas</span>
          <span id="kpiConf" class="kpi-val val-ok">0</span>
          <span class="kpi-sub">ACK Google Sheets</span>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi">
          <span class="kpi-label">Pendientes / Errores</span>
          <span class="kpi-val"><span id="kpiPend" class="val-warn">0</span> / <span id="kpiErr" class="val-err">0</span></span>
          <span class="kpi-sub">Cola / Fallidas</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- GRÁFICA Y COLA SECUENCIAL -->
      <div class="grid-main">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-header">
            <span class="card-title">Tendencia Térmica en Tiempo Real (°C)</span>
            <span style="font-family:var(--mono);font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--text-muted);">
              ● Verde: Confirmada | ● Ámbar: Pendiente | ● Rojo: Error
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="chart-wrap">
            <canvas id="trendCanvas"></canvas>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-header">
            <span class="card-title">Cola de Escritura & Bitácora de Estado</span>
            <span id="workerBadge" style="font-family:var(--mono);font-size:0.74rem;color:var(--text-muted);">WORKER: INACTIVO</span>
          </div>
          <div id="queueList" class="queue-list">
            <div style="color:var(--text-dim);font-size:0.82rem;padding:0.5rem;">
              Sin registros en la sesión actual. Configure credenciales y presione «Iniciar».
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ANÁLISIS OPENAI Y HISTORIAL SHEETS -->
      <div class="grid-main">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-header">
            <span class="card-title">Historial Consultado desde Google Sheets («Registros»)</span>
            <span id="sheetsCountBadge" style="font-family:var(--mono);font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--accent);">0 FILAS</span>
          </div>
          <div class="table-wrap">
            <table>
              <thead>
                <tr>
                  <th>Timestamp</th>
                  <th>ID</th>
                  <th>Zona</th>
                  <th>Variable</th>
                  <th>Valor</th>
                  <th>Unidad</th>
                  <th>Observación</th>
                  <th>Origen</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody id="sheetsTableBody">
                <tr>
                  <td colspan="8" style="color:var(--text-dim);text-align:center;padding:1.2rem;">
                    Aún no se ha consultado la hoja «Registros».
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-header">
            <span class="card-title">Diagnóstico IA (Datos Reales en Sheets)</span>
            <span id="aiStatus" style="font-family:var(--mono);font-size:0.74rem;color:var(--text-muted);">EN ESPERA</span>
          </div>
          <div id="aiOutput" class="ai-output">Presione «Analizar con OpenAI» para que Google Apps Script lea los registros realmente persistidos en Google Sheets y solicite al modelo un diagnóstico basado exclusivamente en evidencia.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- =========================================================
         PESTAÑA 2: CREAR ARTEFACTO (ARQUITECTURA + CODE.GS)
         ========================================================= -->
    <section id="tab-build" class="tab-panel">
      <div class="doc-grid">
        <div class="card doc-section">
          <h2>1. Arquitectura e Intermediación (Apps Script)</h2>
          <p>
            Esta HMI opera como cliente desacoplado sobre <strong>GitHub Pages</strong> (archivos estáticos). Dado que un navegador no debe escribir directamente con credenciales OAuth de Google ni invocar la API de OpenAI exponiendo secretos en producción, <strong>Google Apps Script</strong> actúa como middleware REST:
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Idempotencia garantizada:</strong> Cada lectura generada en la HMI recibe un identificador único (<code>ID</code>). Si una petición se reintenta por latencia de red, <code>Code.gs</code> verifica si ese <code>ID</code> ya existe en la columna B de la hoja <strong>«Registros»</strong> antes de insertar.</li>
